content.text:
Travel and the other downstream services are stable, so payment is the only fault with its own resource signal. I have enough to answer.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-payment-service",
      "fault_kind": "container_cpu_saturated",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, ROUND(AVG(value),3) AS avgv, ROUND(MAX(value),3) AS maxv FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND metric IN ('k8s.pod.cpu.usage','k8s.pod.cpu_limit_utilization') GROUP BY metric", "claim": "Payment pod CPU usage peaked near 4.6 cores, with limit utilization up to 0.92, versus about 0.02 cores normally."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT 'abn' AS p, ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) AS p95_ms, COUNT(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' UNION ALL SELECT 'nor', ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1), COUNT(*) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server'", "claim": "Payment server p95 rose from about 30 ms normally to about 2,280 ms in the incident window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(AVG(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms, ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND span_name IN ('PaymentController.pay','PaymentRepository.findByOrderId','SELECT Payment') GROUP BY span_name", "claim": "Payment's pay and findByOrderId spans are slow while their SQL child spans stay at a few milliseconds, so time is lost in-process."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-payment-service", "to": "ts-inside-payment-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT attr_span_kind, attr_http_response_status_code AS code, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(AVG(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-inside-payment-service' AND span_name='POST' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Inside-payment's POST calls to payment return 503 after about 3.4 s, and only about 7 of 15 reach a payment server span."}]},
    {"from": "ts-inside-payment-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p, span_name, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95, SUM(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) errs FROM (SELECT 'abn' p, * FROM abnormal_traces UNION ALL SELECT 'nor' p, * FROM normal_traces) WHERE service_name='loadgenerator' AND span_name='HTTP POST http://ts-ui-dashboard:8080/api/v1/inside_pay_service/inside_payment' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "User-facing inside_payment requests slowed from about 1.9 s to 19.7 s p95 and some failed; inside-payment returned 500s on 8 of 15 pay calls."}]}
  ]
}
```

